<view class="login stagger">
  <view class="login__brand">
    <view class="login__logo">🔥</view>
    <view class="login__title">火花面板</view>
    <view class="login__desc">抖音火花自动维护 · 小程序版</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card login__card">
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field__label">面板用户名</text>
      <input
        class="field__input"
        value="{{username}}"
        bindinput="onUser"
        placeholder="如 polarstar"
        placeholder-class="ph"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <text class="field__label">密码</text>
      <input
        class="field__input"
        password
        value="{{password}}"
        bindinput="onPass"
        placeholder="面板登录密码"
        placeholder-class="ph"
        confirm-type="done"
        bindconfirm="submit"
      />
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{err}}" class="login__err">{{err}}</view>

    <button
      class="btn btn--primary btn--block"
      loading="{{loading}}"
      disabled="{{loading}}"
      bindtap="submit"
    >
      {{loading ? '登录中…' : '登录'}}
    </button>

    <!-- [20261016] 微信一键登录：openid 已在面板侧绑定时，连密码都不用输 -->
    <view class="login__or"><text>或</text></view>
    <button
      class="btn btn--ghost btn--block login__wx"
      loading="{{wxLoading}}"
      disabled="{{wxLoading || loading}}"
      bindtap="wxLogin"
    >
      <text class="login__wxIcon">💬</text>
      <text>{{wxLoading ? '微信登录中…' : '微信一键登录'}}</text>
    </button>
    <view class="login__wxHint">
      [20261017] 点了才登录，进的是这个微信**第 1 次**绑定的那个账号（换绑要找管理员）。
      没绑定过的话：用下面的账号密码登录一次，登录成功即自动绑定。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="login__foot">
    <text wx:if="{{envOk === true}}" class="small muted">云环境连接正常</text>
    <text wx:elif="{{envOk === false}}" class="small login__envfail">{{envMsg}}</text>
    <text wx:else class="small muted">正在检查云环境…</text>
  </view>
</view>
